      "decision": "accept",
      "why": "The insertion of 'five (5)' is consistent with the mutual nature of the agreement and is a standard duration for NDA obligations."
    }
  ],
  "comment_to_them": "We accept your change to a five-year survival period; it is at the upper end of our acceptable range, but we can agree to it."
  ,
